@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Ring Design — Select, Configure or Submit Reference Image
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest or Member|
start
:Choose design approach;
if (Approved ring model?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Load Manager-approved model;
  :Mark route as catalogue design;
  stop
elseif (Component configurator?) then (yes)
  |Member|
  :Choose available component options;
  |System|
  :Validate against approved components\nand hard constraints;
  if (Selection valid?) then (yes)
    :Mark route as configured design;
  else (no)
    :Explain constraint and require a valid selection;
  endif
  stop
else (Reference image)
  if (Member with eligible booking context?) then (yes)
    :Read consent wording and give explicit consent;
    :Submit reference image;
    |System|
    :Validate request, consent and rate limit;
  if (Request accepted?) then (yes)
    |AI Vision API|
    :Assess image quality;
    :Return candidate features only;
    |System|
    :Evaluate candidate features with approved\nhard constraints, scores and thresholds;
    :Create pending human-review request;
    if (Estimated value <= 3,000,000 VND?) then (Staff)
      |Staff|
      :Review candidate features and estimate context;
    else (Manager)
      |Manager|
      :Review candidate features and estimate context;
    endif
    |System|
    :Record Accepted, Rejected or Clarification Required\nwith actor, reason and design version;
    :Show reviewed result or required next action;
  else (no)
    :Do not send image to AI;
    :Show consent, quality or rate-limit error;
  endif
  else (Guest / not eligible)
    :Do not send an image;
    :Show Member-only requirement;
  endif
endif

note right
Guest cannot enter the image branch. AI only returns image quality and candidate features.
Human review is mandatory; AI cannot decide feasibility, price, acceptance or rejection.
end note
stop
@enduml
